{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A granddaughter. A lifetime of memories. A story woven through the objects left behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong>, you play as Meredith Carter, returning to her late grandmother\u2019s home to sort through a lifetime of belongings.<br>Each item holds echoes of Margaret &quot;Peggy&quot; Carter\u2019s life, shaped by war, love, hardship, and hope across generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a narrative-driven walking simulator without combat or puzzles. Instead, you engage with letters, journals, and keepsakes to uncover deeply personal stories from 1940 to 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong> offers a quiet and reflective journey about memory, loss, and the enduring ties that connect generations.<br>It is brought to life through immersive voice acting, atmospheric visuals, and historically inspired environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will launch on May 16, 2025.<br>Add it to your Wishlist and discover the memories left behind.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668830?t=1746150174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668830?t=1746150174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668830/f7579067d08953186b05cb2627327c1908ba9e4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746150174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668830/f7579067d08953186b05cb2627327c1908ba9e4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746150174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A granddaughter. A lifetime of memories. A story woven through the objects left behind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong>, you play as Meredith Carter, returning to her late grandmother\u2019s home to sort through a lifetime of belongings.<br>Each item holds echoes of Margaret &quot;Peggy&quot; Carter\u2019s life, shaped by war, love, hardship, and hope across generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a narrative-driven walking simulator without combat or puzzles. Instead, you engage with letters, journals, and keepsakes to uncover deeply personal stories from 1940 to 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pieces Left Behind</strong> offers a quiet and reflective journey about memory, loss, and the enduring ties that connect generations.<br>It is brought to life through immersive voice acting, atmospheric visuals, and historically inspired environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game will launch on May 16, 2025.<br>Add it to your Wishlist and discover the memories left behind.</p>","developers":["PULSUSBYTE"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668830/e4c70fa758e0dc5738fa4bedf11b97b5de8b95ba/header.jpg?t=1746150174","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Pulsus Byte. All rights reserved. \"Pieces Left Behind\" is a trademark of Pulsus Byte.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130977,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130977/movie480.mp4?t=1745592238","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130977/movie_max.mp4?t